#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:6
msgid "PLIC Interrupt Controller"
msgstr "PLIC 中断控制器"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:10
msgid ""
"The PLIC (Platform-Level Interrupt Controller) driver provides a system "
"interrupt management interface. It allows developers to configure "
"interrupt priorities, enable or disable specific interrupt sources, and "
"manage interrupt preemption (nesting)."
msgstr ""
"PLIC（平台级中断控制器）驱动提供系统中断管理接口。它允许开发者配置"
"中断优先级、启用或禁用特定中断源，以及管理中断抢占（嵌套）。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:12
msgid ""
"The interrupt handling mode (General vs. Vector) is determined at compile"
" time via system configuration (`.config`)."
msgstr ""
"中断处理模式（常规模式 vs. 向量模式）在编译时通过系统配置（`.config`）确定。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:14
msgid "**Key Features:**"
msgstr "**主要特性：**"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:16
msgid "Compile-time selection of global interrupt mode (General / Vector)"
msgstr "编译时选择全局中断模式（常规 / 向量）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:17
msgid "Interrupt priority and threshold management"
msgstr "中断优先级和阈值管理"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:18
msgid "Interrupt source enable/disable"
msgstr "中断源启用/禁用"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:19
msgid "Interrupt nesting support"
msgstr "中断嵌套支持"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:20
msgid "Optional software interrupt support (Trigger, Enable, Disable)"
msgstr "可选的软件中断支持（触发、启用、禁用）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:22
msgid "Data Types and Enums"
msgstr "数据类型和枚举"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:24
msgid "Interrupt Priorities"
msgstr "中断优先级"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:26
msgid "`enum tlk_irq_priority`"
msgstr "`enum tlk_irq_priority`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`TLK_IRQ_PRI_LEV0`"
msgstr "`TLK_IRQ_PRI_LEV0`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Priority 0 — no interrupt generated (effectively disabled)"
msgstr "优先级 0 — 不产生中断（实际禁用）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`TLK_IRQ_PRI_LEV1`"
msgstr "`TLK_IRQ_PRI_LEV1`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Priority Level 1 (Lowest)"
msgstr "优先级级别 1（最低）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`TLK_IRQ_PRI_LEV2`"
msgstr "`TLK_IRQ_PRI_LEV2`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Priority Level 2"
msgstr "优先级级别 2"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`TLK_IRQ_PRI_LEV3`"
msgstr "`TLK_IRQ_PRI_LEV3`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Priority Level 3 (Highest)"
msgstr "优先级级别 3（最高）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:35
msgid "API Reference"
msgstr "API 参考"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:37
msgid "`TLK_PLIC_ISR_REGISTER` (Macro)"
msgstr "`TLK_PLIC_ISR_REGISTER`（宏）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:39
msgid ""
"A helper macro to define and register an Interrupt Service Routine (ISR) "
"for a specific interrupt number. It automatically generates the correct "
"function attributes for Vector or General mode."
msgstr ""
"一个辅助宏，用于为特定中断号定义和注册中断服务例程（ISR）。"
"它会自动为向量模式或常规模式生成正确的函数属性。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`isr`"
msgstr "`isr`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "The C function name to be called as the handler"
msgstr "作为处理函数调用的 C 函数名称"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`irq_num`"
msgstr "`irq_num`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "The interrupt number (e.g., `IRQ_UART0`)"
msgstr "中断号（例如 `IRQ_UART0`）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:50
msgid "`tlk_plic_interrupt_enable`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_interrupt_enable`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:52
msgid "Enables a specific interrupt source."
msgstr "启用特定的中断源。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:58
msgid "`tlk_plic_interrupt_disable`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_interrupt_disable`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:60
msgid "Disables a specific interrupt source."
msgstr "禁用特定的中断源。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:66
msgid "`tlk_plic_set_priority`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_set_priority`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:68
msgid "Sets the priority level for a specific interrupt source."
msgstr "设置特定中断源的优先级级别。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:74
msgid "`tlk_plic_set_threshold`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_set_threshold`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:76
msgid ""
"Sets the global interrupt threshold. Only interrupts with a priority "
"strictly higher than this threshold will be serviced."
msgstr ""
"设置全局中断阈值。只有优先级严格高于此阈值的中断才会被处理。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:82
msgid "`tlk_plic_set_pending`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_set_pending`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:84
msgid "Manually sets an interrupt source as pending."
msgstr "手动将中断源设置为挂起状态。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:90
msgid "`tlk_plic_clr_all_request`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_clr_all_request`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:92
msgid "Clears all pending interrupt requests."
msgstr "清除所有挂起的中断请求。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:98
msgid "`tlk_plic_preempt_enable`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_preempt_enable`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:100
msgid ""
"Enables interrupt preemption (nested interrupts) for priorities higher "
"than the specified level."
msgstr ""
"为高于指定级别的优先级启用中断抢占（嵌套中断）。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:106
msgid "`tlk_plic_preempt_disable`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_preempt_disable`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:108
msgid "Disables interrupt preemption."
msgstr "禁用中断抢占。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:114
msgid "`tlk_plic_irqs_preprocess_for_wfi`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_irqs_preprocess_for_wfi`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:116
msgid ""
"Prepares the PLIC controller before the system enters a \"Wait For "
"Interrupt\" (WFI) or sleep state."
msgstr ""
"在系统进入\"等待中断\"（WFI）或休眠状态前准备 PLIC 控制器。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:122
msgid "`tlk_plic_irqs_postprocess_for_wfi`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_irqs_postprocess_for_wfi`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:124
msgid "Restores the PLIC state after the system wakes up from WFI or sleep."
msgstr "在系统从 WFI 或休眠状态唤醒后恢复 PLIC 状态。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:130
msgid "Software Interrupt APIs"
msgstr "软件中断 API"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:132
msgid "!!! info \"Requires `CONFIG_TLK_PLIC_SW` enabled\""
msgstr "!!! info \"需要启用 `CONFIG_TLK_PLIC_SW`\""

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Function"
msgstr "函数"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`tlk_plic_sw_set_pending()`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_sw_set_pending()`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Manually triggers a software interrupt"
msgstr "手动触发软件中断"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`tlk_plic_sw_interrupt_enable()`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_sw_interrupt_enable()`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Enables the software interrupt source"
msgstr "启用软件中断源"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`tlk_plic_sw_interrupt_disable()`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_sw_interrupt_disable()`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Disables the software interrupt source"
msgstr "禁用软件中断源"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`tlk_plic_sw_interrupt_claim()`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_sw_interrupt_claim()`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Claims the software interrupt source (typically used inside the ISR)"
msgstr "获取软件中断源（通常在 ISR 内部使用）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`tlk_plic_sw_interrupt_complete()`"
msgstr "`tlk_plic_sw_interrupt_complete()`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Completes the software interrupt, allowing new requests to be processed"
msgstr "完成软件中断，允许处理新的请求"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:142
msgid "PLIC Configuration"
msgstr "PLIC 配置"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:144
msgid ""
"This section describes the PLIC configuration options available in "
"Kconfig."
msgstr ""
"本节描述 Kconfig 中可用的 PLIC 配置选项。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Config"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`TLK_PLIC_VECTOR_MODE`"
msgstr "`TLK_PLIC_VECTOR_MODE`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`y`"
msgstr "`y`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid ""
"Selects the global interrupt handling mode. If enabled, Vector Mode is "
"used (interrupts jump directly to their vector address). If disabled, "
"General Mode is used (all interrupts share a common handler)."
msgstr ""
"选择全局中断处理模式。启用时使用向量模式（中断直接跳转到其向量地址）。"
"禁用时使用常规模式（所有中断共享一个公共处理函数）。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`PLIC_SW` (or `CONFIG_TLK_PLIC_SW`)"
msgstr "`PLIC_SW`（或 `CONFIG_TLK_PLIC_SW`）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "`n`"
msgstr "`n`"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid ""
"Enables support for Software Interrupts. If enabled, APIs like "
"`tlk_plic_sw_set_pending()` become available."
msgstr ""
"启用软件中断支持。启用后，`tlk_plic_sw_set_pending()` 等 API 将可用。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:151
msgid "Interrupt Handling Modes"
msgstr "中断处理模式"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "**General**"
msgstr "**常规模式**"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid ""
"All interrupts share a single entry point; query the interrupt source in "
"the ISR"
msgstr ""
"所有中断共享一个入口点；在 ISR 中查询中断源"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "**Vector**"
msgstr "**向量模式**"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md
msgid "Each interrupt source has an independent vector address; direct jump"
msgstr "每个中断源具有独立的向量地址；直接跳转"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:158
msgid "Interrupt Nesting"
msgstr "中断嵌套"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:160
msgid "PLIC supports priority-based interrupt preemption:"
msgstr "PLIC 支持基于优先级的中断抢占："

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:162
msgid "High-priority interrupts can preempt low-priority interrupts"
msgstr "高优先级中断可以抢占低优先级中断"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:163
msgid "Control the minimum response priority via `tlk_plic_set_threshold`"
msgstr "通过 `tlk_plic_set_threshold` 控制最小响应优先级"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:165
msgid "Integration with GPIO Interrupts"
msgstr "与 GPIO 中断的集成"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:167
msgid "GPIO interrupts are routed through PLIC. Configuration steps:"
msgstr "GPIO 中断通过 PLIC 路由。配置步骤："

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:169
msgid "Configure PLIC interrupt priority"
msgstr "配置 PLIC 中断优先级"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:170
msgid "Configure GPIO interrupt trigger condition (`tlk_gpio_irq_configure`)"
msgstr "配置 GPIO 中断触发条件（`tlk_gpio_irq_configure`）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:171
msgid "Register GPIO interrupt callback (`tlk_gpio_irq_add_callback`)"
msgstr "注册 GPIO 中断回调函数（`tlk_gpio_irq_add_callback`）"

#: ../../source/peripherals/plic.md:172
msgid "Enable global interrupts (`tlk_core_interrupt_enable`)"
msgstr "启用全局中断（`tlk_core_interrupt_enable`）"
